{"Title":"An Act relative to clinical laboratory testing","BillNumber":"H2186","DocketNumber":"HD756","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T11:16:15.417"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T11:16:15.4166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2186/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Gordon of Bedford, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2186) of Kenneth I. Gordon relative to clinical laboratory testing.  Public Health.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 8 of chapter 111D of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting in line 22 after the words “upon the written request of” the following:- the person from whose body the specimen was derived. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J16","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J16"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}